q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 35.3 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 11 TL (A structure keeps all fields belonging to one patient together, so a patient can be sorted or swapped as one object without) Tj T* (synchronizing several arrays. Functions can receive one pointer to the record, reducing repeated parameters and making the) Tj T* (interface clearer. Nested date and blood-pressure structures group related values and can be reused. New fields can be added to) Tj T* (Patient without creating and maintaining another parallel array.) Tj T* ET
Q
