BT 1 0 0 1 7 77.9 Tm /F3 7.1 Tf 8.5 TL (for \(int i = 0; i < n - 1; ++i\) {) Tj T* (    int min = i;) Tj T* (    for \(int j = i + 1; j < n; ++j\)) Tj T* (        if \(patients[j].age < patients[min].age\) min = j;) Tj T* (    if \(min != i\) {) Tj T* (        Patient temp = patients[i];) Tj T* (        patients[i] = patients[min];) Tj T* (        patients[min] = temp;) Tj T* (    }) Tj T* (}) Tj T* ET
